# Plane API access for integrations/sync-roadmap.sh
#
# Copy to secrets/plane.env and fill in. Gitignored; mode 0600.
#
# How to get each value:
#   PLANE_API_KEY
#     Plane -> your avatar -> Profile -> API tokens -> create a personal token.
#     (Plane's own docs: self-hosting -> Instance admin.)
#   PLANE_WORKSPACE_SLUG
#     The slug in the URL after you create the workspace, e.g. in
#     http://<host>:8080/<workspace-slug>/projects/ the slug is the first
#     path segment.
#   PLANE_PROJECT_ID
#     Project -> Settings -> the project's identifier is shown in the URL;
#     this is the project UUID, not the human identifier (PLANE_PROJECT_IDENTIFIER).
#
# Verify without writing anything:
#   make plane-sync ARGS="--check"
PLANE_API_KEY=
PLANE_WORKSPACE_SLUG=
PLANE_PROJECT_ID=
